From 5562cd5963ae8a5dee1565d27e9c4f3c4886de7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akbar Holturaev <akbarholturaev11@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 14:03:25 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(download): show real macOS install screenshots in the
 quick guide
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The quick guide only had drawn mock-ups, and on current macOS the Gatekeeper flow no longer matches them: the app is blocked outright, Open Anyway lives in System Settings and needs admin auth, and the keychain asks for a password on first launch.

Split the guide into per-platform step lists so macOS can document all six real steps with cropped screenshots, and keep the existing three Windows steps untouched. Highlight the Разрешать всегда keychain button in the screenshot and recommend it in the text so users are not asked again.
